url: "https://github.com/HTanvir0011/Thesis-full-project/releases/tag/v1.0.0"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - chest radiography
  - bone suppression
  - counterfactual evaluation
  - lesion fidelity
  - nodule detection
  - knowledge distillation
  - Swin transformer
  - explainability
  - uncertainty quantification
